 "lore": {
  "intro": "Medical isolation. The ward was sealed\nfrom the inside. The seal is intact.\nThe ward is not empty.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: Isolation ward. Camera shows movement. It also shows you, which is odd, because you're with me."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:2",
    "text": "Ratio: There you are on the ward camera. Twice. Commando, wave. ...Both of you waved."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "pickup:red",
    "text": "Ratio: You saw it, didn't you. The other one picked its handle up at the same time."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "kills:10",
    "text": "Ratio: The ones coming out of that wall \u2014 their wounds are on the wrong side. You're shooting the same things twice."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: Theory. The station's connected to somewhere that folds back on itself. Corollary: somewhere can see us."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 3,
    "pos": [
     680.0,
     -105.0
    ],
    "text": "ISOLATION LOG\nDay 1: patient stares at south wall.\nDay 2: patient talks to south wall.\nDay 3: patient answers.\nDay 4: two voices. One patient.\nDay 5: [no further entries]"
   },
   {
    "room": 4,
    "pos": [
     890.0,
     35.0
    ],
    "text": "PATHOLOGY\nSubject recovered from ward.\nAll organs mirrored. Situs inversus totalis.\nSubject's ID chip reads valid.\nIt is the chip of a crewman standing\nguard outside."
   },
   {
    "room": 4,
    "pos": [
     890.0,
     105.0
    ],
    "text": "ISOLATION WING \u2014 DISCHARGE NOTICE\nThe discharge bolt takes its handle from the\nward side. There is no handle on this side;\nthat is the design. The seal team carried the\nward handle in with them when they closed it.\nNobody has carried it back out."
   },
   {
    "room": 0,
    "pos": [
     15.0,
     70.0
    ],
    "text": "GUARD LOG, WARD ENTRANCE\n0600 \u2014 on post.\n0600 \u2014 on post.\nSame hand, same ink, two lines, no gap between\nthem. Whoever wrote it isn't answering the page.\nPost considered staffed. Post considered."
   },
   {
    "room": 3,
    "pos": [
     575.0,
     -50.0
    ],
    "text": "ADMISSION CHART, WARD BED 1\nPatient reports hearing own voice from an empty\nbed. Attending's note: patient IS the only\noccupant. Chart amended twice to reflect one (1)\npatient, current census.\nCensus taken again at shift change: two (2) beds\noccupied. Census not amended a third time.\nAttending went off shift and did not return for\nhandoff."
   }
  ]
 },
